#.  The libc4 and libc5 versions return
#.  .B OPEN_MAX
#.  (set to 256 since Linux 0.98.4).
#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The glibc version of B<getdtablesize>()  calls B<getrlimit>(2)  and returns "
"the current B<RLIMIT_NOFILE> limit, or B<OPEN_MAX> when that fails."
msgstr ""
"Die Glibc-Version von B<getdtablesize>() ruft B<getrlimit>(2) auf und gibt "
"den aktuellen Wert von B<RLIMIT_NOFILE> zurück oder B<OPEN_MAX>, wenn der "
"Aufruf fehlschlägt."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
#: opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Portable applications should employ I<sysconf(_SC_OPEN_MAX)> instead of this "
"call."
msgstr ""
"Portable Anwendungen sollten anstelle dieses Systemaufrufs "
"I<sysconf(_SC_OPEN_MAX)> verwenden."

